{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is detected, move, grab it, check and complete specific task. Otherwise, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
